| Method                      | Time Complexity      | Space Complexity   | Extra Data Structure? | Notes                                               |
| --------------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| **Brute-Force (Nested Loops)** | O(n * m)             | O(1)               | No                    | Very slow for large arrays.                         |
